@startuml Kelola_Keuangan_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Keuangan

actor Admin
participant "Financial Dashboard" as View
participant "Income/Expense Controller" as Controller
database DB

Admin -> View: Buka menu keuangan
View -> Controller: index()
Controller -> DB: Ambil ringkasan dan transaksi
DB --> Controller: Data keuangan
Controller --> View: Tampilkan dashboard

Admin -> View: Tambah transaksi / filter data / approve transaksi
View -> Controller: store() / filter() / approve() / reject()
Controller -> DB: Simpan atau update data
DB --> Controller: Berhasil
Controller --> View: Tampilkan pesan sukses

@enduml